"description": "Inchcape Plc engages in the provision of automotive services and other related products. It operates through the Distribution and Retail segment. The Distribution segment is involved in exclusive distribution, sales, and marketing activities of new vehicles and parts. The Retail segment focuses on the sale of new and used vehicles, together with associated aftersales activities of service, body shop repairs, and parts sales in the UK and Europe. The company was founded in 1811 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.",
